2. LOCAL & PERSONAL USE
You are permitted to download, compile, modify, and use the Software locally
and privately on your personal devices without restriction.

3. REDISTRIBUTION OF ORIGINAL SOFTWARE
You are permitted to redistribute the original, unmodified Software, provided
that:
- You clearly identify it as an unofficial distribution of the original
